# perfboard-studio
===
 Free desktop app for laying out circuits on perfboard, stripboard (veroboard) and breadboards: draw the schematic, auto-place and route it, check it with DRC and LVS, and get a step-by-step soldering guide with multimeter checkpoints. Windows, macOS, Linux..
